                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_author rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_author rendering_contributiontojournal_author"><a rel="Person" href="https://pure.qub.ac.uk/en/persons/francisco-liberal/" class="link"><span>Liberal, Francisco D. C. Guerra</span></a> ; Parsons, Jason L. <a rel="Person" href="https://pure.qub.ac.uk/en/persons/stephen-mcmahon/" class="link"><span>; McMahon, Stephen J.</span></a> / <a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://pure.qub.ac.uk/en/publications/most-dna-repair-defects-do-not-modify-the-relationship-between-re/" class="link"><span><strong>Most DNA repair defects do not modify the relationship between relative biological effectiveness and linear energy transfer in CRISPR-edited cells</strong></span></a>. In: <a rel="Journal" href="#" class="link"><span>Medical Physics</span></a>. 2024 ; Vol. 51, No. 1. pp. 591-600.</div>
